<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces are in Haiti searching for four missing soldiers after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince, while Benin has pledged 2,000 troops to help combat gangs. Hunger is worsening as high food prices and El Niño persist, and the postponed presidential election is now set for July 2027. Bukele’s deployment of Salvadoran troops adds a foreign military element, and he has denied allegations of airstrikes by his forces. The United Nations reports 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNV0U2a2V6bWNlZWhPWktxYmtOTU5xWE1WU2pfVl9FMEgxakx5bXJUZFVzU0RTM195RmY1ZW1Wdk0weTMtajRfeXQxY3BlR2NpbS1fb3JCXzY5MWZxdDZMek1QcjNRWi04bmNJb3lZSjlTMERVbnZETHJZZGI5MnB4SnhycWhRR2Z3OWhSckNnSGhYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOYVd1ejRXeTFWd2ZCUTFFb1REVWtEQWFXWm9xRENBUVMzVmR3aF8yZTRKalIxVTd1NzdwYmNJUDNnZVlFXzN4RXFxV18wd0NfcDIxQ0ozZXNxaVVBbE1pY1EzWERoeDB2Tk1LSlQwOWhqdUxNckFOWlhpaFpQZl9wVkllNzk1RThBc3NyRm1CeXRwMUpCUl9FTjR6enpvWnlreGVkRkFJVVAyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNUTRhYlVTNW9meXRiT1BnaERHMVoyeTROOFQwSHJBLV9aV2VJZmQ5RDdBeTRLNkJ0LUJjNmpWdU4tSF9kRUlDTmpaR1g0UlpfR1FPOFQtaGJGakoyTUF3RFdCOGxWZ0NPc3lWNEU5NWpmbWoxNGd5ZEQ0Rl9LbnI4eEpOTUp4czhLX3ZjbWFqQ3JvNjJBNU1vZlRvU05NdWZjWUlJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPTkstc0NuRHpFUFBoWkp4ZDFVVHhmUU40UFVGODhrSkpfZm9DaVIzSXl4ZmlnTjlINVE0NFVJSHJHUmIzUzJobEIyWHdoSzFKd3dfTW9FRFRzVV8yZm9tQkZXWS1QSU9GSFB6ZzVDNVMwSXRKVG9xZ3Ix